{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QEE54vcon6neg7g9LXM4b8","type":"tool_result","content":"30\t3.3 Hiring both together costs £23 per booking day.\n31\t3.4 Only active members may borrow equipment.\n32\t3.5 Deposits, hire duration and return rules are in film-equipment.md.\n33\t3.6 A booking day is defined in section 2 of film-equipment.md.\n34\t\n35\t## 4. Payment\n36\t4.1 Payments may be made by cash or bank transfer.\n37\t4.2 Cheques and instalment payments are not accepted.\n38\t4.3 Fees must be paid in full before the relevant service is provided.\n39\t4.4 The treasurer issues a receipt for payments of £10 or more.\n40\t4.5 A payment is received when cash is handed over or a transfer clears.\n41\t\n42\t## 5. Refunds and adjustments\n43\t5.1 Membership fees are non-refundable after membership begins.\n44\t5.2 Ticket and equipment refunds follow film-refunds.md."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9108020e-7958-4558-9e1f-907e357a85e4","uuid":"261eff77-c843-47d2-8312-e4f2576cfd51","timestamp":"2026-10-12T17:27:14.279Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\tc\\open-9WXX\\w1\\reference\\film\\film-fees.md","content":"3.3 Hiring both together costs £23 per booking day.\n3.4 Only active members may borrow equipment.\n3.5 Deposits, hire duration and return rules are in film-equipment.md.\n3.6 A booking day is defined in section 2 of film-equipment.md.\n\n## 4. Payment\n4.1 Payments may be made by cash or bank transfer.\n4.2 Cheques and instalment payments are not accepted.\n4.3 Fees must be paid in full before the relevant service is provided.\n4.4 The treasurer issues a receipt for payments of £10 or more.\n4.5 A payment is received when cash is handed over or a transfer clears.\n\n## 5. Refunds and adjustments\n5.1 Membership fees are non-refundable after membership begins.\n5.2 Ticket and equipment refunds follow film-refunds.md.","numLines":15,"startLine":30,"totalLines":47}},"tool_result_meta":[{"